1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,110
I asked a dead
sign where it was.

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,280
It answered.

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,100
Last night, it spelled help.

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,890
It was never plugged in.

5
00:00:07,990 --> 00:00:09,980
So tonight I took it apart.

6
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:10,500
No gas.

7
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,160
No wires.

8
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,820
Nothing to light.

9
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,470
I put it back, and
I asked out loud.

10
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:16,710
Where are you?

11
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:18,960
The glass had changed.

12
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,750
Nine.

13
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,360
But there is no
nine on this street.

14
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,350
My shop is seven.

15
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,980
The street ends here.

16
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,140
I went outside to prove it.

17
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,710
And there it was.

18
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,020
A door, painted over.

19
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,910
Under the paint, a nine.

20
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:35,800
It was nailed shut.

21
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,280
From the inside.

22
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,200
I knocked.

23
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,990
Every sign on the
street went dark.

24
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:44,720
Then one came back.
